<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνυγρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the water, aquatic,</i>
			of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Spir.</u>
				482a21
			</span></i>: 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνυδρος</span>
			, of plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.21.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.11.13
			</span></i>, v.l. in Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.134
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wet, damp,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					351a19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					569b21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>watery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					12.58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>involved in</i> loss at <i>sea,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραγμάτων φθορεὺς καὶ ἔνυλός τε καὶ
					ἔνυγρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Rhetor.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.151
			</span></i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξει . . χρημάτων ἀποβολὴν καὶ
					ἐμπρήσεις καὶ ναυαγίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heph.Astr.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
